# Project-specific
# Ignore all sample XERs (may be client data) EXCEPT the bundled Harbour
# Point demo set, which ships so the deployed app has a working sample
# toggle. Any file added here MUST be synthetic — never client data.
sample/*.xer
!sample/Harbour Point DCP-03 - Baseline Programme Rev 0.xer
!sample/Harbour Point DCP-03 - Update Programme Rev 8.xer
